==German==

===Etymology===
From {{af|de|Meer|t1=sea|Schwein|t2=pig, swine|-chen|pos3=diminutive suffix|lit=little sea pig}}, or from {{af|de|Meerschwein|-chen}}. The use of {{m|de|Meer}} refers to the animal as coming from overseas.

